# Internal planning documents — local-only, like AGENTS.md, specs/ and vdd/. They describe an
# earlier state of the application and several name routes it no longer serves, so they must not
# reach a clone: mkdocs builds every file under docs/ and would otherwise publish them. The files
# stay on the workstation; they were untracked with `git rm --cached`, and these entries keep them
# out. `docs/plan-15min.md` is covered by the same reasoning.
/docs/plan.md
/docs/plan-context.md
/docs/plan-product.md
/docs/plan-delivery.md
/docs/test-plan.md
/docs/plan-15min.md

